{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方、\nありがとうございます:)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*****\n沢山のコメント、本当にありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心に響いて、胸が熱くなって、\n...泣いてしまった。\nあっ、また泣いたね？\nなんて言わないで‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、本当にみなさんに感謝したい。\nことばじゃ足りません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はみなさんの声で\n何度も何度も助けられてるんだな。\nって本当に思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんがいてくださるから\n私は頑張れるんだな。って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝の気持ちをちゃんとかたちで表したい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「成長したね」\nと思ってもらえるように。\nもっとだいすきになってもらえるように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーとして、学んだこと。\nこれから学ぶこと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全て自分にとって大切なことなんだ。\n必要なことなんだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遠くてもいいんです。\nでも、離れないでください。\nずっと見ててください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待っててください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか、チャンスの順番がくるまで..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*****"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はLesson前にねねが\nお家に遊びに来ました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやー最近部屋掃除してたから\nよかったー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねねがなんかうきうきしてて\nこっちの伊藤家を占領してました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねね「私、人の部屋探るのすきなんだよね～」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか「ひいぃぃー」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊藤ちゃんずだうぇーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"べっ別に調子乗ってねぃしっっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に歌とダンスの練習もしてました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お家で遊ぶのもいいね☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Lesson、大変だけどもやっぱり楽しい‼\n楽しむことって大事だな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しんだら自然と笑顔になるもんね:D"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も頑張るっっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問回答します‼\n..............\n好きなスポーツはなに？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンス♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベビたんは中学の時何部だったの？(*^^)v"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと帰宅部だったよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、その分バレエめっちゃ通ってた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪行ったらベビたん喜んでくれる？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そりゃもう毎日会いたいもん‼\nうれしいです＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テスト勉強はどうやってやってますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ノートに書いてあるのを\n裏紙にひたすら書きまくるよ‼"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テストどうだった？(*'ω'*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん:)なんとかっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりりは髪の毛染めたいとか思う？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一度は染めてみたいなーて思うっ\nでも、もともと茶色めなんだ。\nけっこう今の髪色すきよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなサイリウムの色はなんですか？\nまりちゃんの好きなサイリウム\n買いに行きますε=ε=(ノ≧∇≦）ノ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂カラーが一番いいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0011.gif","alt":""