まい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0026.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あああマリカー俺もきのこ頭の子使う!!!\nちなみにキノピオ君だから\n覚えたげてね(´・ω・｀)笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えっ知ってるよ。\nキノピオちゃんでしょ⁇\nあえて言わなかったんだよ‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいによるとこの子けっこう強いそうです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0027.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな映画調査中です!!\n好きな映画教えて～!!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パコと魔法の絵本\nHIGH SCHOOL MUSICAL\nバックトゥザフューチャー\nサンダーバードの実写版"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"べびたんファッション好みすぎてやばい！\nおれも古着とか好きやわ（＾Ｏ＾☆♪\n服の話とかしてくれるー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱい話したいなっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"べびさんは抱っことおんぶ、どっちが好き？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...おんぶ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0031.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0031.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺のくせしてピンク好きって珍しい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男だからとか全然関係ないです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0032.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありあり‼\nピンクいいですよねx)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピンクの中にもいろんな色がありますよね。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0033.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0034.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0035.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0036.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それはピンク色以外もだけどもね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベビたんはマンガとかよむんかな？\nもし読むんやったら好きなやつ教えて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"君に届け\nストロボエッジ\nアオハライド\nハチミツとクローバー\nご近所物語"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"です＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"萌え～って言ってもいい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もえもえっ\n...あ。\n私はそんなの似合わんかった笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし、メイド服着よう。←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"べびたんが普段似てるって言われる\n芸能人は誰ですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オーディションのときから\n井上真央さんに似てると言われます。\n恐縮です><\n斜め横顔でニッて笑った顔が特に‼て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ますます、人気が出ても仲良くしてくれますか？(照)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てれちゃうなあ。\nてれてれします。\nもちろんよx)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんからのコメントは\nかかさず読んでるし、\nみなさん一人一人が私にとって\nすごく大切な存在です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大切な大切なfamily"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0037.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ChU"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンスがうまい人といえば、\nろってぃのイメージが強いみたいだけど、\n僕はベビたんも相当うまいと思うんだけど、\n乃木坂入る前になんかやってたの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンスだいすきだから\nめっちゃうれしいっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0038.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バレエはずっと習ってたけどね、\nダンスも昔からすきで\nちゃんとは習ってなかったけど、\n踊ることがすきなんです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\"可愛い\"と\"きれい\"と\"かっこいい\"\nどれが一番言われたいですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どれもうれしいよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0039.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ、\"きれい\"早いんかな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なまえ握手会の時いうから\n覚えてくれる？(笑)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログに毎日コメ\nしてれば名前いえば\n覚えててくれますか♪？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもコメントしてくださる方、\nなまえ覚えていますよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりちゃんは犬派？猫派？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちもかわいいやーんx(\n選べないよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0040.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...てこのデコメねこちゃんや。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまで"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0041.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":".............."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長文読んでくださって\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、一回で100だ‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も元気に頑張りまりかです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4308329/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベビたん*****bA by marika"}],"source":"archive"}